1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,300
Justice for everyone, close to home.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,300
A public portal for every citizen: services, laws and legal aid,
in English and Amharic.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,300
Submit a complaint, track it with a private code,
and see it through to resolution.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,300
