what they are responsible for.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,300
Every case has an automatic deadline,
and every delay has a reason on record.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,300
Leaders see which zone is behind, and why,
with reports ready in one click.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,300
Laws, research and training,
available on any device.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,800
Southern Ethiopia Regional Justice Portal.
Justice, dignity and public service.
